WEBVTT

00:00:19.990 --> 00:00:24.580
The Dresden Slates, the treasure that has given birth to kings...

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.630
We are now witnessing its true brilliance.

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:30.510
A joyous moment. Simply magnificent!

00:00:30.880 --> 00:00:33.130
The light that will revolutionize the world...

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:35.640
It’s so beautiful...

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.010
Nagare...

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:41.810
Does this mean the world’s gonna
start changing into the new one?

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.350
It’s not going to start changing.

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.770
The change has already taken place.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:48.150
What do you mean, “already”?

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.820
The Dresden Slates is an apparatus that

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:55.700
is meant to evolve all of mankind
to the level of kings like us.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:59.530
It was the Silver King who initially awakened it...

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:04.540
But that stubborn Gold King put a lid on its capabilities.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:09.790
So until now, it’s been running in safe mode.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.550
However, there is nobody left to suppress the Slates.

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:18.430
The Slates are back to its full power...

00:01:18.430 --> 00:01:19.640
And with it,

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.430
the chance for all of mankind to evolve into kings!

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:27.440
A chance for all of mankind...

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:29.810
You mean, outside is...

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.440
Probably total chaos.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.320
Yes.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.700
When the masses who were powerless
until now acquire powers...

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:43.080
existing order will be destroyed
and a new world will be born.

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:45.290
It will be a world where one controls one’s destiny...

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.210
where one forges their own path.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.960
A world where one stands a chance

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.340
against meeting a senseless death...

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:55.090
Affirmative.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:01.470
So does that mean I now get to
fight kings like you, Nagare?

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.220
That’s awesome. I can’t wait!

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.310
The stronger they are,

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:08.730
the better it feels when you beat them!

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:14.440
A new world will be created where kings fight kings.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.490
A paradise of natural selection.

00:02:17.490 --> 00:02:21.070
And we’re going to be the flowers that blossom...

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:22.740
in that world!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:26.000
Sounds like shit...

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.680
Have you decided where we’re going on Saturday?

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.760
Where do you want to go?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.510
What is that?!

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:11.060
It’s like that time...

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:28.030
Mishina!

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:30.370
Are you okay?

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:51.680
<i>This is... just like that</i> <i>time a year ago.</i>

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.150
No!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.570
Kukuri!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:08.780
Phew, thank goodness...

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:10.080
Just in the nick of time.

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:11.040
Shiro-kun!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.250
Kukuri...

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.540
We have a favor to ask of you.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.420
Me?

00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:17.170
Yes.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:19.840
It is something only you can do.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:30.560
<i>We continue with the latest development surrounding the sudden outbreak of people manifesting powers.</i>

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:33.980
<i>Since the start of this year,
there have been multiple incidents reported</i>

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:35.690
<i>where people started to display strange powers.</i>

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:39.810
<i>But around noon today,
the number of reports has skyrocketed.</i>

00:05:41.020 --> 00:05:42.650
<i>In response to this serious turn of events,</i>

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:45.820
<i>the government has issued a state of emergency
and is asking all citizens to remain indoors.</i>

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:50.120
<i>Similar phenomena are being
reported throughout the world.</i>

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.410
Any word from JUNGLE?

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:55.580
Nothing yet.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:58.120
This is outrageous!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:06:02.340
I wasn’t told that all this chaos was going to happen!

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.720
At this rate, we’ll have
a diplomatic crisis on our hands!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.760
Yelling at me won’t help...

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.850
What was that?!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:14.810
What’s going on?

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:21.270
What the...

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:23.730
I can see right through the wall!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.650
What?

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:26.820
Rioters have broken into the official residence...

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:35.660
Y-You!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:37.330
Call a bodyguard!

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.170
Get me Munakata-kun!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.460
But Mr. Prime Minister...

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.790
You dismissed Munakata Reisi.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:45.800
Oh no, that’s right!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.470
Munakata-kun!

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.850
I’m sorry!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.810
Please save me!

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:02.650
Hey, there’s an urgent request
for help from the Prime Minister.

00:07:03.110 --> 00:07:05.520
What should I do with this?

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.610
At the present time, the importance of

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:12.280
the existing government’s power has taken a nosedive.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.660
I see no need to help them.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.040
Please ignore it.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:19.080
Gotcha.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.420
We’ve come a long way, haven’t we?

00:07:28.090 --> 00:07:29.470
Affirmative.

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.430
In order to evade the Gold King’s endless pursuit,

00:07:33.430 --> 00:07:38.430
we had to go into hiding for a long time.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:43.270
Oh yeah, you definitely scared
the hell out of me with that one.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:47.360
I mean, trying to pick a fight with the Gold King?

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:49.940
And the fact that you got your
ass kicked didn’t help either.

00:07:50.700 --> 00:07:53.450
An innocent boy does a little mischief,

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.830
and he got so upset.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:58.950
Kokujoji Daikaku was quite immature...

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:00.910
for an old man.

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:04.380
I thought I was going to die. I regretted it.

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:08.210
Oh well, it’s all over now.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.880
The Gold King is dead...

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.300
and the Slates belong to us free and clear.

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.350
It’s not over yet.

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.810
This time, it’s the opposite from a month ago...

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:24.020
It’s our turn to protect, and theirs to attack.

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:28.070
Looks like the kid still hasn’t learned his lesson.

00:08:28.070 --> 00:08:30.740
Is this why you ordered all passageways

00:08:30.740 --> 00:08:33.030
to be closed except the Yomito Gate?

00:08:33.030 --> 00:08:33.950
Yes.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:38.160
At the same time, we cleared all civilians from the Yomito Gate area,

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.580
and assembled U-Rank players at this secret base.

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.250
Does that mean

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:49.210
you’re assuming that they’ll even
infiltrate the secret base?

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:54.300
The possibility of them making it
to where the Slates and I reside,

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:56.220
is not zero.

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.220
However...

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:01.720
As long as I am connected to the Slates,

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.190
I have no time limit.

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:05.940
It’s limitless.

00:09:05.940 --> 00:09:10.940
And the odds that they can
beat me as such, does not exist.

00:09:10.940 --> 00:09:12.230
It’s zero.

00:09:12.230 --> 00:09:17.360
Therefore, there’s no need
for two Kings to stand guard here.

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:21.990
I’m going to ask you to welcome
the Blue King, Iwa-san.

00:09:24.910 --> 00:09:28.000
You’re expecting that to happen too?

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:31.500
Everything that is possible is probable.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:34.510
With the Slates’ power,

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:39.140
you can manifest your manipulation
ability to the max, right?

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:41.430
Then I wonder...

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:48.150
If you can also manipulate things
that happened in the past?

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.610
For example, my losing ticket at the races

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.780
turns into a winning ticket...

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.900
Or, you know...

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.700
I’m sorry, Iwa-san.

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:02.910
Huh? What for?

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:05.500
I can’t do that...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.040
Even with my powers...

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.420
Changing the past is impossible.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:14.670
Yeah, I guess so.

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:17.930
That would be too good to be true.

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.850
I guess it just means that hard, steady work

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.810
is still the surest and quickest way to happiness.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:29.980
Well, I’ll be going.

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:32.190
Yes, please be careful.

00:10:32.190 --> 00:10:34.360
<i>Well, it does make sense...</i>

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:38.700
<i>Changing the past and doing it over</i> <i>just isn’t your style.</i>

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:43.950
<i>Your power is to correct the present</i> <i>and change the future.</i>

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.450
<i>So use that power...</i>

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:51.250
<i>Use it to reshape this giant toy box
called the world... The way you see fit...</i>

00:10:51.250 --> 00:10:53.000
<i>Nagare...</i>

00:10:53.790 --> 00:10:57.340
<i>Please remain calm and</i> <i>act rationally.</i>

00:10:57.340 --> 00:11:01.260
<i>I know how scared you must feel to suddenly have these strange powers...</i>

00:11:01.510 --> 00:11:04.890
<i>But you can suppress it!</i>

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:08.100
<i>Try to remember what happened</i> <i>a year ago.</i>

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.440
<i>That time when this school</i> <i>came under attack.</i>

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:15.900
<i>We must become like</i> <i>the man who saved us!</i>

00:11:16.230 --> 00:11:20.530
<i>This power isn’t something to</i> <i>be used for destruction!</i>

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:24.580
<i>It’s something to protect</i> <i>ourselves!</i>

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:26.700
<i>So please...</i>

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.410
A year ago...?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:33.670
That’s right...
There was someone who helped us.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:35.790
We can do this.

00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:45.180
<i>I’ll do my best over here.</i>
<i>Shiro-kun, Kuro-kun, Neko...</i>

00:11:51.390 --> 00:11:52.060
Everyone...

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.240
Hey, look.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.860
Yeah... Just as we were told.

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:07.450
Still can’t believe the Blue King would show up like this.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.540
I guess there’s no doubt

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:12.750
that JUNGLE’s headquarters is up ahead.

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:18.210
Well, that pillar of light was glowing
for 15 minutes and 30 seconds...

00:12:18.210 --> 00:12:20.590
It’s hard not to draw attention.

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.340
There are quite a few of them.

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.390
Shall I lead off?

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:26.140
No, that won’t be necessary.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.470
Your task isn’t to clear the path.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.100
You’re going in yourself, Captain?

00:12:32.600 --> 00:12:35.270
I’m no longer the captain.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:38.940
Just an ordinary king.

00:12:40.480 --> 00:12:42.030
They went through the blockade tape!

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:43.820
Activate Protocol A!

00:12:43.820 --> 00:12:46.450
Shoot! Just attacking earns you points!

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:49.830
Watch your aim!
There’s only two of ‘em!

00:12:49.830 --> 00:12:51.830
Hold your positions, everyone!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.710
Is every team ready?

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.500
Shoot at will!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:04.630
Incidents with superpowers have skyrocketed!

00:13:04.630 --> 00:13:08.390
It’s as though the citizens have all turned into Strains...

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:12.350
Some cases are escalating into violence.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:13.930
This is unconfirmed,

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:17.400
but there are reports that the Prime
Minister’s official residence was attacked.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:21.900
Lieutenant, with all this happening,
are we still supposed to just stand by?!

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:28.070
As long as the order stands, there’s nothing we can do.

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.330
If that’s the case...

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.120
What’s the purpose for our being here?!

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:33.660
Fuse!

00:13:34.080 --> 00:13:36.540
All we can do now is to gather intel.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.000
Any progress on getting in touch
with the Captain?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:42.630
No.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.880
Lieutenant, please take a look at this.

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:47.300
What is it?

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.720
We were monitoring the pillar of light
that appeared at Yomito...

00:13:53.520 --> 00:13:55.390
Look at this image...

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:57.190
The Captain?!

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:58.900
And Zenjo-san too!

00:13:58.900 --> 00:14:00.060
Are they up against...

00:14:00.060 --> 00:14:01.860
The Green Clan?!

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.360
They’re going into enemy lines
with just the two of them?

00:14:04.360 --> 00:14:05.530
That’s suicide!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.240
The Green Clan...

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:09.320
Could one of them be Fushimi-san?!

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.370
Don’t be crazy!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.330
But why did he only take Zenjo-san with him?

00:14:18.460 --> 00:14:20.080
Captain...!

00:14:21.630 --> 00:14:24.340
I’m resigning from SCEPTER 4!

00:14:25.510 --> 00:14:30.090
As long as I remain with SCEPTER 4,
I’m not allowed to leave the premises.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:34.220
I cannot involve the rest of you
and force you to disobey orders!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.930
This may sound selfish,

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:39.310
but I’ve reached the end of my limit.

00:14:39.310 --> 00:14:40.480
Still...

00:14:46.280 --> 00:14:47.860
Still...

00:14:47.860 --> 00:14:52.280
I want to remain the Blue King
Munakata Reisi’s right-hand man.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.660
Even if he’s no longer a public figure,

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.790
I want to serve him...

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.120
and do whatever must be done.

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:02.000
That is my duty!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.750
Lieutenant...

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:07.710
I’m sorry, Akiyama.

00:15:07.710 --> 00:15:11.050
As of this moment, you are in charge of SCEPTER 4.

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.050
I’m leaving.

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:15.890
Understood.

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:17.430
As you just heard,

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:21.900
I am now in command of SCEPTER 4.

00:15:21.900 --> 00:15:24.270
Here are my orders as the acting captain!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:26.020
We will now proceed

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:28.490
to the headquarters of the Green Clan JUNGLE,

00:15:28.490 --> 00:15:30.900
who masterminded this entire scheme,

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:32.910
and we will neutralize the situation!

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:34.530
What?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:36.910
Furthermore, during this operation,

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.160
the safety of the citizens is our top priority.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:42.420
Do whatever is possible to protect them.

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:44.380
Yes, sir!

00:15:45.920 --> 00:15:47.050
Don’t be ridiculous!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:49.210
Weren’t you listening to me?!

00:15:49.210 --> 00:15:51.130
That’s disobeying orders...

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:53.260
It’s no use, Lieutenant...

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:55.140
I mean, Awashima-san.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.470
You’re an average citizen now.

00:15:58.470 --> 00:16:01.140
Someone that we’re supposed to protect.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.730
Here, take it.

00:16:02.730 --> 00:16:04.650
This is an emergency situation.

00:16:04.650 --> 00:16:06.150
Under authority of SCEPTER 4,

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:08.400
it is loaned to you for the purpose of self-defense.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.030
That okay with you, Akiyama?

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:14.780
Yes. I authorize it
as the acting captain of SCEPTER 4.

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.200
You guys...

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.460
All right. Let’s go.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:29.000
SCEPTER 4, move out!

00:16:29.000 --> 00:16:30.210
Yes, sir!

00:16:30.210 --> 00:16:31.510
Get’em!

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:32.760
Go!

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:47.860
Damn, it’s no use!

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:51.240
Your moves are so predictable.

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:54.320
This plasma bullet packs the same amount of power

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.280
as the Lightning Bolt Jutsu.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.790
It should take down even the Blue King!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.170
My apologies for the intrusion.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.590
If you hadn’t done anything,

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.010
it would have saved you some trouble.

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.600
Surely, you jest.

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:21.220
Shit, it didn’t work!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.930
The gate can only be opened from the inside!

00:17:23.930 --> 00:17:26.980
Even the Blue King can’t go through it alone!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:33.610
Now, we wait...

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.620
Hello, Saruhiko.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.620
You sure work fast.

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:48.500
I’m impressed.

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:55.340
I know what you’re up to.

00:17:55.340 --> 00:17:58.390
You intend to invite the Blue King in.

00:17:58.890 --> 00:18:02.220
Then you should hurry up and kill me.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:04.350
There’s no need.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.140
And there’s no reason to either.

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:08.850
As long as you don’t open the gate,

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:11.650
then you will not be considered a traitor.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.900
A J-Rank has the right
to walk freely around the secret base.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:20.450
And a duel between clansmen is also not prohibited.

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:22.120
Meaning the moment I open this gate,

00:18:22.120 --> 00:18:25.910
I’ll be disposed of as a traitor, right?

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:27.910
You understand things quickly,
and that saves time.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:32.090
The Blue King cannot reach this place.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:34.590
You’ll just die meaninglessly.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:35.920
A dog’s death.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.550
Is that a threat?

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.800
No, an invitation, Saruhiko.

00:18:39.800 --> 00:18:44.260
I’m offering you the chance to truly be one of us.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:48.440
Your personality isn’t for HOMRA or SCEPTER 4.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:53.520
You’re best suited to JUNGLE, which honors free will.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.910
It’s true...

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.660
If I stay here, I won’t have to deal with idiots,

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:06.580
or be forced to obey a superior’s reckless orders.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.000
Affirmative.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:11.080
Then my answer’s obvious.

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.960
No thanks.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.750
That’s unfortunate.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:16.510
Caw!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:18.510
You’re dead! Dead! Dead!

00:19:20.840 --> 00:19:23.680
If you’re no longer on our side...

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:29.270
Then I guess I can kill you now... Right?!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:44.320
Impossible!

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.540
The gate’s opening! How can that be?!

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:48.410
No, wait!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:50.410
That’s...!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.960
Holy cow...

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.170
They really managed to open it.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:19:59.550
Nagare’s foresight never ceases to amaze me.

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:03.340
There’s no need to assist me.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:06.810
Just focus on the task you’ve been assigned with.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:08.390
Understood.

00:20:08.390 --> 00:20:10.640
What’s up, Munakata!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:14.650
Oh, and that face behind you brings back memories!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:18.150
Zenjo Goki, the right-hand man of Habari Jin.

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:22.240
Gray King Ootori Seigo...

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.910
It’s been fourteen years.

00:20:23.910 --> 00:20:26.660
You sure have aged.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:29.540
And you... have dried up.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.040
Can’t argue you with you there.

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:45.140
Bring as many as you want,
none of you will get past me.

00:20:46.680 --> 00:20:51.930
No more holding back,
shows of mercy, or stalling...

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:53.890
Not this time.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.400
What?!

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:26.890
I see...

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:30.430
I guess I can’t stop a vessel of such magnitude...

00:21:30.430 --> 00:21:33.390
When all of my fog’s attention
is directed towards you.

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:36.230
That’s so unlike you, Munakata.

00:21:36.230 --> 00:21:39.610
Volunteering to act as decoy.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:42.440
There seems to be some kind of misunderstanding.

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:44.650
That had nothing to do with me.

00:21:44.650 --> 00:21:47.160
I am still your main opponent.

00:21:47.160 --> 00:21:50.160
Well, not that it matters.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.790
My role is to greet you!

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.690
Munakata...

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.440
Ready!
